      <h2>5. ORDER CANCELLATIONS &amp; VERIFICATION</h2>
      <p>We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any order placed with us. In the event that we make a change to or cancel an order, we will attempt to notify you via email or phone/WhatsApp number provided at checkout.</p>

      <h2>6. PAYMENT TERMS</h2>
      <p>We accept Cash on Delivery (COD), Direct Bank Transfer, and Easypaisa (+92 325 5136747). All transactions are encrypted and processed securely.</p>

      <h2>7. CONTACT INFORMATION</h2>
      <p>Questions regarding the Terms of Service should be directed to our client services team at <strong>Eloura.pk1@gmail.com</strong> or via WhatsApp at <strong>+92 325 5136747</strong>.</p>
